1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,570
Invader, I will take your life !

25
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,610
He's Core Formation ?

26
00:02:03,350 --> 00:02:05,210
Formation, activate !

27
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:08,450
Note: Wang Lin got this formation from the Evil Devil Sect disciples he killed.

28
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:17,370
Can this formation trap a Core Formation cultivator ?

29
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,170
If you were at Peak Late stage,

30
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,330
then this formation

31
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:34,090
might have stood a chance against me.

32
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:36,850
It's a shame you're just a Middle stage Foundation Establishment...

33
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:45,690
Go !

34
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:05,130
I will kill you, I will kill you.

35
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,810
I'll slash you to death, bastard !

36
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,290
Foundation Establishment brat,

37
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:13,450
taste the power of Core Formation !

38
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:16,050
That guy is cunning.

39
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,170
He would never attack

40
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:18,330
without absolute certainty.

41
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,850
Could it be...

42
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,570
Xu Liguo, what are you waiting for ?

43
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,690
Do you want to die ?

44
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:24,890
I knew it...

45
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,530
Damn heavens,

46
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,770
why is this my fate ?

47
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,330
But... If I devour a Core Formation cultivator,

48
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,210
my power might increase dramatically !

49
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:43,610
Then I will be able to kill my ungrateful master

50
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,450
and I'll be free

51
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,010
to roam through

52
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,530
heaven and earth !

53
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:56,410
I'm done playing with you !

54
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,970
Your soul is restricted

55
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:01,330
and you can't escape my Bloodfiend Demon Formation.

56
00:04:11,160 --> 00:04:13,410
This Divine Sense is mine !

57
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:18,810
Stop this !

58
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,330
No no no

59
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:21,450
I'll give it back...

60
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,770
Come back

61
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,770
or I will kill you immediately.

62
00:04:57,840 --> 00:05:00,530
If the Evil Devil Sect's jade slip is correct

63
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,730
then absorbing a Golden Core can boost my cultivation.

64
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:05,490
This is my key to Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

65
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:15,570
Where is he ?

66
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,610
Find him !

67
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:17,210
Understood !

68
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,730
The spiritual energy in a Golden Core is immense !

69
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:48,930
Unfortunately, I can only absorb 10% of this energy

70
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:52,010
since I didn't cultivate the Great Freedom Asura Art.

71
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:59,330
Congratulations Master on reaching Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

72
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:02,130
Wang Lin
Peak Late stage
Foundation Establishment

73
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,210
Scout ahead

74
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:02,610
instead of talking.

75
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:16,600
Master...

76
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,810
You haven't told me

77
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,170
where we're going to.

78
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,690
The Burning Fire Alliance.

79
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,450
Oh..

80
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:05,090
Very good.

81
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,690
At this rate,

82
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,490
you might even win the Heaven Separating Pill.

83
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:10,930
However,

84
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,210
I'm wondering how

85
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,730
you were able to advance so quickly.

86
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,410
Just before,

87
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:19,130
you were Middle stage Foundation Establishment.

88
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,970
It's embarrassing but

89
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,770
Junior encountered a severely injured Core Formation cultivator.

90
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:24,970
To be able to defend myself,

91
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,530
I had no choice but to take his Golden Core.

92
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,650
That's how my cultivation rose

93
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,610
to Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment.

94
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,530
This is the second map piece.

95
00:07:38,840 --> 00:07:40,930
When you fulfill your next task,

96
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,130
come to me

97
00:07:41,880 --> 00:07:43,570
for the third piece.

98
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:50,930
Country of Xuanwu

99
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:53,410
Burning Fire Country

100
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:56,170
Nan Dou City

101
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:56,170
Sea of Devils

102
00:07:52,280 --> 00:07:54,090
The continent's information

103
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,930
must be on that final map piece.

104
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,130
Thank you, Senior.

105
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,730
Wang Lin,

106
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:02,210
the cultivators of Xuanwu have gathered

107
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,890
so a great battle is approaching.

108
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,810
Whether you are seeking

109
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,610
the map or the Heaven Separating Pill,

110
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:08,410
the next few days

111
00:08:08,320 --> 00:08:10,010
will be your best opportunity.

112
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,090
Fellow cultivators !

113
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,970
Fellow cultivators,

114
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:17,050
our Nascent Soul physical bodies were attacked

115
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:18,730
and the Country Sealing Formation

116
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,890
has shattered...

117
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:23,050
The Fire Spirit Beasts are coming !

118
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:27,050
The Heaven Defying Bead absorbed the Fire Spirit Beast King

119
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,330
so I'm sure the Fire Spirit Beasts will look everywhere for me.

120
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,850
I can't stay here anymore.

121
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:32,490
Forget the Heaven Separating Pill,

122
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:34,610
I need the map in order to return to Zhao.

123
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,130
Yang Xiong,

124
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,530
why were you looking for me ?

125
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,210
Senior...

126
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,690
Master, I've done what you asked.

127
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,370
As for my Soul Blood...

128
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,850
I'm sorry.

129
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:19,210
Ancestor Feng Luan is my mother.

130
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,010
When she saw me,

131
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,610
she knew something was wrong.

132
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,810
So...

133
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:27,050
I didn't come for your Soul Blood.

134
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,970
I just need your help for something.

135
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,130
Is it about the map ?

136
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,610
My homeland is far away

137
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,690
and I have no way to find it

138
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,210
without a map.

139
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,930
Then help me kill 2 people.

140
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,290
You know them both.

141
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:45,570
The first is Ma Liang's childhood friend Xu Si

142
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,330
and the other

143
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:49,490
is that scoundrel Zhou An who's been with her.

144
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,810
I trust you, Senior.

145
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:53,370
Come back in an hour

146
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,890
and I'll give you the map.

147
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,410
Deal.

148
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,570
Ma Liang...

149
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:02,850
This is the last thing I can do for you...

150
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,650
Disgusting...

151
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,490
Who would've thought Ma Liang

152
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:10,010
would actually return alive ?

153
00:10:10,160 --> 00:10:11,390
Are you

154
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:12,810
still thinking about him ?

155
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,570
Of course not.

156
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,050
Don't you feel that

157
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,330
since he returned,

158
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,010
he seemed like a different person ?

159
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:25,090
A mere Foundation Establishment cultivator

160
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,330
being so high profile

161
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:28,610
cannot end well for him.

162
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,770
Ma Liang,

163
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:33,970
I will kill the person you once loved

164
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:36,130
but that has heartlessly abandoned you.

165
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,810
I wonder how you would feel

166
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:40,730
if you were still here.

167
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,610
Xu Si... Xu Si !

168
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,690
You two were doomed anyway.

169
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:52,690
Not just because of my promise to Zhou Zihong,

170
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:54,610
but because

171
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:58,090
I will never leave any potential danger behind anymore.

172
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:18,490
The Sea of Devils

173
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:21,530
is like hell on earth.

174
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:24,290
It's filled with a malevolent aura.

175
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,890
The cultivators here

176
00:11:26,640 --> 00:11:29,450
are cunning like foxes,

177
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,530
treacherous and ruthless.

178
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:34,810
Most of them come from the outside

179
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,810
but their rebellious nature

180
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:38,250
or their bloody past

181
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,050
forced them to flee.

182
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:43,010
They all end up gathering here

183
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:46,650
in the Sea of Devils where everyone cultivates

184
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:49,170
like a Devil.

185
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,610
This Sea of Devils is too dangerous.

186
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:02,290
I'm only at Peak Late stage Foundation Establishment...

187
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,850
If I want to return to Zhao,

188
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:05,570
it will be extremely difficult.

189
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:07,690
Young lady,

190
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:11,010
I have killed every single member of your squad.

191
00:12:10,760 --> 00:12:12,850
Do you think you can run away ?

192
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:25,650
The Luo River Sect has been testing poisons for generations,

193
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,050
if you're not afraid...

194
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:30,410
It's too dangerous for a girl to do alchemy and test poisons.

195
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,330
Wouldn't it be awesome to have someone

196
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,730
for Dual Cultivation ?

197
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,810
He's Middle stage Core Formation.

198
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,300
I can't handle him without

199
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,530
the Bloodfiend Demon Formation.

200
00:12:49,920 --> 00:12:52,370
A Junior who knows the Earth Escape Technique ?

201
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,170
Since we've met,

202
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:58,010
I might as well kill you too !

203
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:05,810
Senior !

204
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,050
Save me.

205
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:11,970
Senior,

206
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,770
he's from Xuanwu's Dual Cultivation Sect.

207
00:13:13,760 --> 00:13:16,210
He knows that I have a Heaven Separating Pill.

208
00:13:16,320 --> 00:13:18,130
If Senior can save me...

209
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:21,250
He can't save you.

210
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:43,650
Do you really have a Heaven Separating Pill ?

211
00:13:44,360 --> 00:13:46,530
We are both from the Burning Fire Alliance.

212
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,850
Even if he's a madman,

213
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,330
falling into his hands

214
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:52,890
is better than being caught by that Core Formation from Xuanwu.

215
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:55,610
I don't have a complete Heaven Separating Pill,

216
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,450
just a half-finished product.

217
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,810
The Luo River Sect's Heaven Separating Pills

218
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,130
are always half-finished !

219
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,890
It just needs half an hour to refine.

220
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,450
Once a Heaven Separating Pill is completed,

221
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,210
it must be consumed within an hour

222
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:07,530
or it will be useless.

223
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:12,530
Are you looking for reinforcements from the Burning Fire Alliance ?

224
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:14,250
Did I allow you to do that !?

225
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,290
I'm no match for him,

226
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:24,330
I only have one way

227
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:25,450
to shake him off.

228
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,170
Senior,

229
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,970
you're going towards the Burning Fire Country.

230
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,290
It must at least be 3 hours

231
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,730
since the formation broke.

232
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:34,130
Excluding the time for the Nascent Soul

233
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,690
to get back to deliver the message,

234
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:36,890
The Fire Spirit Beasts

235
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:38,690
must have already entered Xuanwu.

236
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:41,490
The game is over for you !

237
00:14:41,640 --> 00:14:43,130
Now is the time !

238
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:45,970
What's this?

239
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:54,370
Weren't the Fire Spirit Beasts sealed by the formation ?

240
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:56,930
Wait, we should report this !

241
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:58,170
They already know,

242
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,610
don't worry about it.

243
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:03,850
Shit,

244
00:15:03,680 --> 00:15:05,090
they saw us.

245
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:19,290
3 days later

246
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,570
He appears to be at Foundation Establishment

247
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:29,370
but he's been using the Earth Escape for 3 days straight to cross the country.

248
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:32,690
The Burning Fire Alliance couldn't resist those beasts

249
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,650
so how does he plan to escape them ?

250
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:43,210
Senior...

251
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:45,770
This... this is the Sea of Devils !

252
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,850
I know.

253
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:51,730
Maybe someone in the Sea of Devils

254
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,890
might be able to stop the Fire Spirit Beasts.

255
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:57,770
Besides, the Sea of Devils is thousands of times bigger than the Burning Fire Country.

256
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,250
Even the Fire Spirit Beasts

257
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,290
will struggle to find us behind this thick fog.

258
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:02,210
Senior,

259
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:03,850
am I correct ?

260
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,450
Yes.

261
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:07,690
The Sea of Devils I wanted to avoid

262
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,970
ended up becoming our only way out.

263
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,730
Cold Yin spiritual energy ?

264
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:22,250
The Sea of Devils is like a wall of ice

265
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:25,770
that contrasts with the Burning Fire Country's heat.

266
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:48,290
Everything has a weakness,

267
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:51,730
this cold fog can suppress Fire Spirit Beasts.

268
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,490
Our priority now

269
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:56,530
is to find a cave and have me reach Core Formation.

270
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,150
The only way to survive the Sea of Devils

271
00:16:57,960 --> 00:17:00,170
is to have me form my Golden Core

272
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,810
so that I can become the strongest person under Nascent Soul.

273
00:17:04,770 --> 00:19:06,900
Dual Cultivation has multiple meanings. It can just mean a marriage between 2 cultivators.
But the second meaning is the exploitation and absorption of spiritual energy through sex (which is the method of the Dual Cultivation Sect that Core Formation cultivator is part of). In that system, the male represents the Yang and the female the Yin, both complementing each other.

In the event that one is stronger than the other, the weaker (generally the woman) will become the other's "cultivation furnace".

The term "cultivation furnace" is more widely used for any kind of exploitation of someone else to further one's cultivation.

That's why he was keeping Li Muwan alive.

274
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:16,170
I've been walking this path for endless years

275
00:17:12,580 --> 00:17:16,170
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

276
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:21,770
Is it the compass of fate

277
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:21,770
that wrote this outcome for us ?

278
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:27,690
The heavens want to erase your existence,

279
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:33,410
that's the obsession guiding me.

280
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:39,010
Is this the path to uncover

281
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:39,010
truths from falsehoods ?

282
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:44,610
In a world of murk and shadow,

283
00:17:40,940 --> 00:17:44,610
only the flame of truth can light the way.

284
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:50,330
Look at them all,

285
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:50,330
being carried by the waves.

286
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:54,970
Look at them all,

287
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:54,970
being drowned.

288
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:58,290
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

289
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:01,370
I will let the world refine my soul.

290
00:18:01,250 --> 00:18:06,930
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

291
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:06,930
I will fight.

292
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:10,050
I'll break through the abyss of despair

293
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:13,090
to finally learn who I really am.

294
00:18:12,840 --> 00:18:18,450
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

295
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:18,450
I embrace this obsession.

296
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:21,410
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

297
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:24,210
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

298
00:18:23,960 --> 00:18:29,690
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

299
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:29,690
I'll still fight.

300
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:33,050
It's hard to avoid loneliness

301
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:36,090
when you are above everyone else.

302
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:41,770
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

303
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:41,770
be afraid of a firefly ?
